    (4, $c26$WHAT IS THE SIZE OF THE CAMPUS?$c26$, $c26$Geometry, Distance and Measurement, and Coordinate Geometry$c26$),
    (5, $c26$WHO IS THE POKER GUY HERE$c26$, $c26$Probability, Combinatorics, Game Theory, and Derangements$c26$),
    (6, $c26$ASK OUT YOUR CRUSH$c26$, $c26$PROBABILITY AND STATISTICS$c26$),
